OL,3,GNEWSATwo men die in multi-vehicle crash
OL,4,Ain Surrey
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have died in a multi-vehicle
OL,7,Fcrash in Surrey, police have said.
OL,9,FThe collision took place on the A246
OL,10,FEpsom Road at East Clandon just after
OL,11,F23:00 BST on Friday, and involved three
OL,12,FSeat Leons, one black, one white, and
OL,13,Fone grey, Surrey Police said.
OL,15,FThe driver of the white vehicle, a man
OL,16,Fin his late teens, and the passenger, a
OL,17,Fman in his early 20s, died at the
OL,18,Fscene. Their next of kin have been
OL,19,Finformed.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
